#Протокол_WorkGraph_Draft_Intake<[
Базис:
  Старый ioHasC daemon пишет suggestions в steps/suggestions/*.suggested.bvc и NDJSON journal, но rebuild backlog требует controlled promotion в WorkItems.
  Draft store остаётся feeder, не вторым source of truth.
Вектор:
  Intake flow: suggestion/draft atom -> review queue -> operator approval -> new WorkItem atom appended to work/backlog.bvc with provenance labels.
  Provenance labels: intake.source_path, intake.source_kind (suggestion|llm_draft|manual), intake.review_status (pending|approved|rejected), intake.promoted_work.id.
  Promotion requires: StepAtomDraft validation, duplicate work.id check, explicit migration.strategy and target phase assignment.
  Rejected drafts stay in suggestion shard with rejection evidence; they do not mutate canonical backlog.
  Link to old ioHasC: steps/suggestions/, .iohasc/daemon-suggestions.ndjson as reference intake sources (port strategy).
  Promotion rules (deterministic, src/draftIntakePromotionRules.mjs):
    proposal_validation — StepAtomDraft validation passes;
    work_id_present — non-empty work.id;
    migration_strategy — port|rebuild|replace|defer;
    intake_provenance — intake.source_kind + intake.source_path + intake.review_status=pending;
    target_files — at least one target file for code-gap drafts;
    duplicate_work_id — work.id absent from canonical backlog;
    confidence_gate — low-confidence suggestions rejected unless allowLowConfidence.
  Eligible drafts → promotion candidate list (reviewRequired=true); failed checks → rejected list without backlog mutation.
Цель:
  Daemon и LLM draft pipelines могут предлагать задачи, но canonical backlog меняется только через reviewed promotion.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: workgraph-draft-intake
  work.source: design-draft-store-backlog-intake
  trace.status: verified
]>
